"""
Gate 1 — cheap, rule-based hard exclusions. No LLM.
Runs on every recommendation before any model call to fast-fail junk and cut cost.

Operates primarily on Tsenta's STRUCTURED fields (seniorityLevel, yearsOfExperienceMin,
sponsorship, roleFamily) and falls back to title/skill regex for the rest.

The thresholds come from profile.py rather than being hardcoded, because whether a
"Senior" title or a "no sponsorship" flag is a dealbreaker depends entirely on the
candidate. Upstream assumed a new grad needing H1B; this reads the profile flags.

Returns (kept, dropped) where each dropped item carries a reason.
"""
